Please note that this approach requires that your managed code dll is compiled as a standalone executable (not a DLL), because you cannot directly load managed code into a process without it being compiled as an executable. If your dll needs to be loaded into a process, you will need to use P/Invoke to call into unmanaged code to load the dll into a process.

